{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act4d0_level_act4d0_st07",
  "groupId": "act4d0",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "和光同塵",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act4d0/level_act4d0_st07.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7ad4f55de673f63af6723f890d8f211fb2f3649658f6953c823bd75f377c087b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmencommand"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "11:30 A.M.  天氣/多雲\n野外，羅德島總工程師辦公室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次又要做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，我等會能去看看博士嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是好久沒有對{@nickname}惡作劇，又手癢了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，不要那麼警覺嘛！我可是好心在關心人家呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上一次你說關心別人的後果，是創造了一間連續三個月都在午夜零點自動播放“可露希爾的午夜錄影超商”的艙室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還無法調低音量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦好啦，我承認！我確實是想逗逗博士啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然而，Dr.{@nickname}現在是失憶狀態，是否記得你還是個未知數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？是睡太久了睡傻了嗎？好慘哦，之後去給博士送點零食慰問一下好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隨你。只是，別再給Dr.{@nickname}留下些壞印象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "華法琳已經夠糟了，再增加{@nickname}對血魔的誤會，卡茲戴爾的事情會被迫繼續延後。無限期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可是你在他人心目中重新建立自己形象的機會，好好把握。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以前的形象有那麼差嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在中央空調三十六度事件之後，是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，那是機房斷電。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在操作台上找到了你的指紋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是機房斷電！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你黑掉監控刪除了錄影，但操作台有生物備份系統，我有十三張分佈在不同時段的組織切片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起是我的錯那個什麼混帳使節太囂張了我想治治他十分對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，歡迎會呢？Dr.{@nickname}的歡迎會，我們不弄一個嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "免了。現在是非常狀態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，不要這麼冷淡嘛，凱爾希。既然博士失憶了，我們不是更應該讓博士多感受些同伴的溫暖嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以前是這麼看待Dr.{@nickname}的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能......我和博士也沒那麼親近？不過就像你說的，這不是建立自己的美好形象的最佳時機嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希爾，我現在不想聊這個話題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，你不去我就自己去，我可不管你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "話說，按照既定安排，我們是要去龍門沒錯吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能自由行動嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龍門已經變得相當危險了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，龍門有這麼危險嗎？不是說那邊治安還挺好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離切爾諾伯格最近的城市就是龍門，剩下的不用我多說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那為什麼要去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為離切爾諾伯格最近的城市就是龍門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是還隱瞞了什麼理由啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，上次開會的時候，我全都報告了。只是那個時候，你正戴著眼罩躺在會議椅上睡覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "系統維護實在是太累了......不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有責怪你的意思。沒有你的努力，羅德島連啟動都做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我還是要打消你那些奇奇怪怪的想法......你叫我來究竟是為了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，就是叫叫你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我回實驗室了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別走呀！哎其實......三區有兩條走廊斷電了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一起去看看線路嘛，行不行嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叫工程幹員去不就行了。又是供能線路出了問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們親自去看看也沒什麼問題呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "平常我讓你檢查的時候，你可都是交給其他幹員去做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "身為羅德島總工程師的責任感在這一刻又一次覺醒了！我們去吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快走吧，路我比你熟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位是暴雨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，暴雨？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，可露希爾小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好乖的孩子！凱爾希，你看看你看看，這些孩子，個個都比你討人喜歡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暴雨，給我看一下記錄儀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......左臂的，這個嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。小心點，別碰掉針頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......數字正常。嗯，血紅蛋白也回升了。你恢復的不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝凱爾希醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要謝我，這只是我的職責，是我該做的事。別為了別人的職責去感謝他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暴雨。還記得回去的路嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你就自己先回去吧。我和可露希爾還有些事要處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但護衛的事情，我走了，凱爾希醫生不要緊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許你會錯意了，暴雨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才讓你跟著我，是想讓你熟悉一下艦內的環境。以後你可能要常來這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不需要護衛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "speakerId": "char_304_hvrain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼我就告辭了。再見，可露希爾小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽見沒凱爾希，她叫我小姐欸！啊，多好的孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，她好像很想幫上你的忙，你就這麼讓她回去了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每個幹員都需要找到自己的職責，我也一樣。讓她在她無法施展的地方浪費時間，只是我的失職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別老說些沒人情味的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暴雨曾經是薩爾貢的軍事人員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在架設人際關係之前，首先該讓她明確自己的位置，融入羅德島，既需要肯定和包容，也需要她先建立起足夠的自我認知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了行了，你講這些我頭疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正又是你撿回來的囉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ri_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，有時候我在想，你該不會有撿人的天賦吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這已經是第幾個了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是“感染者人才收容與發掘程序”的環節之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等......上個月你連續七十二個小時待在手術台旁邊，那次的手術對象，是不是她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "手術小組至少輪了八、九班......你卻又三天沒睡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少她恢復得很快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告訴我，凱爾希，你是不是又給自己上試劑了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我拒絕回答這個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不問，你就永遠不會說了，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼說的必要？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你對自己太粗暴了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我承受得住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好黑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不要啟用備用電源？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看不見？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可不要小看血魔，我當然能看見啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說是這麼說，我是不是踩到了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，這，這什麼東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用不著大驚小怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......怎麼是扭蛋機？怎麼放在這種地方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？毛茸茸特別收集款？有二十四種不同的毛茸茸和......天啊，隱藏款，天啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可·露·希·爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在黑暗的管道裡搞工程，感覺是好久以前的事了，好懷念啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個時候，羅德島還沒這麼大呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扳手給我一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，Mon3tr，謝謝你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好像勾不到。要嘛凱爾希，你來抬一下？我修一下線路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿咻......這個區域已經徹底斷電了，可以開始排查了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，我說，你覺得去切城營救博士是個錯誤的選擇嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "選擇在那種時候進入切城是不明智的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭非常堅定地做出了選擇，沒人能說服她。何況，你很清楚精英幹員們的傾向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明只是因為你投了棄權票。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道說，這是你對阿米婭的一次考驗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "考驗？不，這不是考驗。或者說，即使這是次考驗，考官也不是我，而是她面對的困境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然這是她發自內心的選擇，那麼，我只會支持她......卻也不能傾盡所能，讓她覺得萬事都會順利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這畢竟是她自己的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說得好聽，這麼搞，善後的不還是你？你不累啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有人從一開始就能把事情做好，可露希爾。我也不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少我們走過了午夜，剩下需要做的，不過是活到太陽升起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及，你頭上第二根電線要掉下來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哎哎！拿穩了！要是三樞供電線掉下來，你我一塊完蛋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，等下，我排下線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就這麼把兩整組線塞在排座後面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安靜！要用心，用心去感受電流的自然與平和。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "建議你自己咀嚼一下自己剛才說了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是啊，凱爾希......欸，好了，你試試開關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說，凱爾希，不管你剛才在打什麼啞謎，你要走夜路，怎麼都得要點光吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不就正在這修燈泡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，燈亮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼你要在今天問這些？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我不問，你就不會說啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老是在肚子裡憋著，想法會變質的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我的答案對你來說可有可無？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得，你說的這些，對你自己可是非~~常重要！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以嘛，比起你說了什麼，更要緊的是......我一定要親耳聽到你說了才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "浪費時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次說明白點，我會直接給你報告書。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可那樣你就不會來了呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰說我不會來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你真的還有燈泡可修。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就說好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每次都是這樣，莫名其妙就和你定了些奇怪的協議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這大概就是工程師的作用吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，你看，這顆燈泡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要說，真亮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，真亮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你如果能一直保持這種態度，那我也安心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那樣的話，即使我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎！快住口。別說啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說別的......趁現在，就趕緊享受下這盞小燈吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是柔和的光芒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
